    {
      "heading": "Hard or soft pattern?",
      "text": [
        "Each gender has a 'hard' and a 'soft' pattern, chosen by the last consonant of the stem.",
        "Soft: ž, š, č, ř, c, j, ď, ť, ň (and masculine nouns in -tel, like učitel). Hard: h, ch, k, r, d, t, n, g. The other consonants (b, f, l, m, p, s, v, z) usually go with the hard pattern.",
